{"chunk_id": "attractions_knowledge_search", "text": "TripAgent Attractions allows users to browse, search, and filter attraction and tour records by city, category, and maximum price.", "source_id": "rag-knowledge:attractions", "authority_tier": "tier_2", "metadata": {"source_type": "feature_knowledge", "feature": "attractions"}, "indexed_at": "2026-10-04T05:06:24.949234+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "attractions_knowledge_categories", "text": "The categories of attractions available are Sightseeing, Culture, Adventure, Entertainment and Food & Drink.", "source_id": "rag-knowledge:attractions", "authority_tier": "tier_2", "metadata": {"source_type": "feature_knowledge", "feature": "attractions"}, "indexed_at": "2026-10-04T05:06:24.949234+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "attractions_knowledge_reviews", "text": "Each attraction can have customer reviews with a rating from 1 to 5. The average_rating field is recalculated automatically whenever a new review is submitted.", "source_id": "rag-knowledge:attractions", "authority_tier": "tier_2", "metadata": {"source_type": "feature_knowledge", "feature": "attractions"}, "indexed_at": "2026-10-04T05:06:24.949234+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "attractions_knowledge_ai", "text": "The Attractions Service provides AI-assisted recommendations using a Plan-Act-Observe-Adapt pattern: it extracts city, category, budget and preferences from a free-text request, filters real database candidates, and only then asks the LLM to explain the best matches.", "source_id": "rag-knowledge:attractions", "authority_tier": "tier_2", "metadata": {"source_type": "feature_knowledge", "feature": "attractions"}, "indexed_at": "2026-10-04T05:06:24.949234+00:00"}
